@startuml
autonumber
A -> B : one
B --> A : two
autonumber 10
A -> B : ten
A -> A : eleven self
autonumber stop
A -> B : plain
autonumber 0
A -> B : zero means one
autonumber -3
A -> B : negative
B -> A
autonumber +7
A -> B : plus seven
autonumber abc
A -> B : bad token means one
autonumber 99999999999999999999
A -> B : overflow means one
autonumberX
A -> B : glued keyword
autonumber 100 10
A -> B : extra tokens ignored\nsecond line
@enduml
